&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-IN&quot;&gt;Work with a dynamic and diverse team that values collaboration, creativity, and growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
